      "message": "git(config): replace regexp excaping with --fixed-value flag (#15053)\n\nFixes #15048\n\nThe `--fixed-value` flag is cleaner than regex escaping and should fix the issue reported by @javerous in #15048.\nThe tests already covers this code: checkout each commit and run `go test ./modules/git -run=TestGitConfig` to see the 2 tests failing and how they are being fixed one after the other.\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/15053\nReviewed-by: Mathieu Fenniak <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
